  "details": "Description\n\nBc of the new ui changes you can no longer ban people from a group instance if they block you. I had a racist person join my instance and they blocked me when i confronted them for it they blocked me and i am now unable to ban them from the group. it is completely missing from the ui. you can only kick the ban option is missing \n\nReproduction Steps\n\nto reproduce the person just has to block you and boom you can't ban them. hell tbh you ain't even gotta be blocked the ban option is just missing from the moderation ui now\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
